            <sparkle:version>107</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.13.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.0

- Word-by-word (karaoke) lyrics now work for Apple Music too, using its built-in syllable timing — brightness sweeps across each word as it's sung.
- Romanization under non-Latin lyrics: songs written in Devanagari, Hangul, kana, hanzi, Cyrillic and more now show a dimmer romanized (Latin) line beneath each lyric. It's done entirely on-device — no network, fully private — so it works for any script and any song. Lyrics already in the Latin alphabet are unchanged.
]]></description>
