            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.12.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.12.0

- Word-by-word (karaoke) lyrics in the full-screen view: when a track has word-level timing available, brightness sweeps across each word in time with the vocal, Apple-Music-style. Songs without word timing keep the normal line highlight.
- Word timing loads quietly in the background and upgrades the lyrics in place, so lyrics still appear instantly and only get richer when the data is there.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/LakshyaSingh/now-updates/releases/download/v2.12.0/Now-2.12.0.zip" length="3486604" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Z2rvgSJqRfa8LQ6MPJhSxL6QZ3SxpCvjQ9LlrV17wVa9txIygaRzkV29NWNj+qXhK53/ZI0H8QPhio9QRTS9AQ=="/>
